      "clipStart": 8,
      "label": "The gap",
      "startFrame": 2042,
      "durationFrames": 353,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now it reads the passage against the firm's own control.",
          "src": "audio/blocked-0.wav",
          "startFrame": 0,
          "durationFrames": 88
        },
        {
          "text": "The period's there. The starting point isn't.",
          "src": "audio/blocked-1.wav",
          "startFrame": 97,
          "durationFrames": 69
        },
        {
          "text": "So it won't work out a due date. It leaves the clock blocked and puts the gap in front of a person.",
